const faqs = [
  {
    q: "How do you ensure female employee safety during night shifts?",
    a: "We strictly enforce industry-leading safety protocols: automated routing guarantees female employees are never the first pickup or last drop during night shifts (8 PM to 6 AM). All cabs and Tempo Travellers have active GPS tracking with SOS capabilities, and driver details with contact numbers are shared with your corporate transport desk in advance."
  },
  {
    q: "What Tempo Traveller seating configurations are available for corporate rental?",
    a: "We provide 12-seater luxury AC Tempo Travellers (with 2x1 pushback leatherette seats for executive delegations and film shoots), 14-seater executive models, 17-seater high-roof deluxe models (ideal for daily IT and factory shift routes), and 20–26 seater mini-buses for large manufacturing plants."
  },
  {
    q: "Can Kalidass Travels handle factory and industrial plant shift transportation?",
    a: "Yes. We actively manage industrial workforce transportation for manufacturing plants and bio-refineries (including active operations with Kaleesuwari Tech Bio Refinery and Mahindra Logistics). We ensure gate entry compliance, punctual shift handovers across morning/evening/night shifts, speed-governed commercial vehicles, and dedicated route managers."
  },
  {
    q: "Do you supply vehicles and Tempo Travellers for cinema film shoots and media agencies?",
    a: "Yes! We specialize in production crew transportation for Kollywood feature films, OTT web series, television commercials, and media production agencies. We provide Innova Crysta for lead actors and directors, alongside 12–17 seater Tempo Travellers for camera, lighting, and art department crews, with flexible 12-hour or 24-hour on-set standby across Chennai studios (Prasad, AVM, EVP) and outdoor locations."
  },
  {
    q: "What happens if a dedicated monthly retainer vehicle or driver falls sick?",
    a: "We provide an ironclad 60-minute emergency backup replacement guarantee anywhere in Chennai. If a vehicle faces mechanical issues or a chauffeur takes sudden leave, an alternate commercial vehicle and background-verified driver are dispatched immediately to prevent any business disruption."
  },
  {
    q: "Do you provide 100% GST-compliant invoices for corporate tax credits?",
    a: "Yes. Kalidass Travels holds active GSTIN registration (33COVPM0531D1Z4). All corporate bookings, monthly retainers, and shift commute contracts receive itemized monthly GST tax invoices with logbook reconciliation, allowing your finance team to claim 100% Input Tax Credit (ITC)."
  },
  {
    q: "Can our company set up a monthly credit / bill-to-company account?",
    a: "Yes! We offer 15-day and 30-day corporate billing credit cycles for registered enterprises following standard vendor onboarding, statutory documentation, and service agreement signoff."
  },
  {
    q: "Are all vehicles registered with commercial yellow boards and verified drivers?",
    a: "100% yes. Every vehicle in our corporate fleet is registered under commercial transport authority permits (yellow board), carries comprehensive commercial passenger insurance, is fitted with ARAI-approved speed governors, and is piloted by Police Verification Certified (PVC) chauffeurs trained in corporate etiquette."
  }
];

